---
description: Fireplace/electric heating controller — pins, 74HC595, 75/55/35 logic
alwaysApply: true
---

This folder is the LCTech ESP32-WROOM-32E 16-ch relay heating firmware. Read AGENTS.md before editing.

Relays are two on-board 74HC595s (GPIO14/13/12/5/4). Never drive pumps/heater/valve from raw ESP32 GPIOs.

Control logic lives in `controlStep()`:
- Fireplace is default (AUTO). Remote UDP can request AUTO / ELECTRIC / FIREPLACE; fireDump still overrides ELECTRIC.
- Electric in AUTO only when T ≤ 35 °C (or no sensor) AND a thermostat is calling.
- fireDump latches at ≥ 75 °C and clears at ≤ 35 °C. dumpPumps latches at ≥ 75 °C and clears at ≤ 55 °C.
- During fireDump: valve fireplace, heater off; both pumps ON if dumpPumps else both OFF (55–35 °C band ignores thermostats).
- Otherwise pump1 = TSTAT1 (GPIO16), pump2 = TSTAT2 (GPIO17).
- JC3248W535C remote is `env:remote` (USB-C on the panel). Do not flash it through the C3 bridge.

Serial upload is through the C3 SuperMini at 115200 with no_reset. Do not flash C3 firmware here. Full flash/OTA notes: README.md.
